# This repo is checked out on Windows, where core.autocrlf=true rewrites every
# newline. Two things here read bytes rather than lines, so a rewritten newline
# is not cosmetic:
#
#   1. state.spec_hash() digests spec.md and spec.json byte for byte. A CRLF
#      checkout changes the hash, so every project approved at Gate 1 reports
#      spec drift and the code and pack phases refuse to run.
#   2. The Workflow tool refuses a script containing control characters, so a
#      CRLF .claude/workflows/*.js makes every documented phase entry point
#      unrunnable - the failure names control characters, not line endings, so
#      it does not point at its own cause.
#
# The whole index is LF today. Pin it that way on checkout so it stays true.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Called out explicitly because these two are the ones that fail silently.
.claude/workflows/*.js  text eol=lf
projects/**/spec.md     text eol=lf
projects/**/spec.json   text eol=lf
